# Shell scripts must use LF regardless of the checkout platform: this repo is
# developed on Windows but the entrypoint runs inside a Linux container, and a
# CRLF shebang line fails with a confusing "no such file or directory".
# The Dockerfile strips CRs as a second line of defence.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Same reasoning for container and CI files that Linux tooling reads.
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
